[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7322.79, "timestamp": "02:02:02", "text": "空间。在此之前，一切都很平静。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7327.03, "timestamp": "02:02:07", "text": "你这话是什么意思？哦，呃，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7331.589, "timestamp": "02:02:11", "text": "就像我现在住的房子，我住在我的房子里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7333.109, "timestamp": "02:02:13", "text": "房子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7336.87, "timestamp": "02:02:16", "text": "我家一楼装修过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7340.87, "timestamp": "02:02:20", "text": "所以它们被翻新，以便它们可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7343.109, "timestamp": "02:02:23", "text": "把它分配给两个办公空间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7346.589, "timestamp": "02:02:26", "text": "东西。所以我住进了一个小房间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7350.189, "timestamp": "02:02:30", "text": "我的东西放在楼上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7356.109, "timestamp": "02:02:36", "text": "是的。所以我认为我们得到了一些呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7360.79, "timestamp": "02:02:40", "text": "像……这样的人，就像……那些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7363.99, "timestamp": "02:02:43", "text": "是租用办公室还是其他什么地方。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7366.39, "timestamp": "02:02:46", "text": "我当时很怀疑，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7368.31, "timestamp": "02:02:48", "text": "现在流媒体等等可能就是这样了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7370.47, "timestamp": "02:02:50", "text": "如果他们要待在那里，对他们来说就太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7372.87, "timestamp": "02:02:52", "text": "晚上或者工作的时候。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7375.75, "timestamp": "02:02:55", "text": "幸好他们最终没有达成一致，所以我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7378.35, "timestamp": "02:02:58", "text": "依然拥有我的平静"}]